### ==============================================================================
### Bright Mind Ltd - Smart Task & Project Management System
### Phase 6: Task Management & Filter Test Suite (VS Code REST Client / Postman)
### Base URL: http://localhost:5000/api
### ==============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api

### 1. Login as User 1 (Alex Morgan - Project Owner)
# @name loginUser1
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "demo@brightmind.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

@tokenUser1 = {{loginUser1.response.body.data.token}}

### 2. Login as User 5 (Tanvir Hasan - Non-Owner)
# @name loginUser5
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "tanvir.hasan@brightmind.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

@tokenUser5 = {{loginUser5.response.body.data.token}}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### CREATE TASK TESTS (POST /api/tasks)
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 3. Create Task Success (Expect: 201 Created)
# @name createTaskSuccess
POST {{baseUrl}}/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "projectId": 1,
  "title": "Set up CI/CD Pipeline on GitHub Actions",
  "description": "Configure linting, automated testing, and zero-downtime deployment workflows.",
  "status": "To Do",
  "priority": "High",
  "assigned_to": 2,
  "due_date": "2026-03-20",
  "checklist": [
    { "id": 1, "text": "Create workflow yml file", "done": false },
    { "id": 2, "text": "Configure repository secrets", "done": false }
  ]
}

@newTaskId = {{createTaskSuccess.response.body.data.task.id}}

### 4. Create Task Validation Error - Missing Title & Project ID (Expect: 400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "InvalidStatus",
  "priority": "Urgent"
}

### 5. Unauthorized Creation: User 5 attempts to create task in User 1's project (Expect: 403 Forbidden)
POST {{baseUrl}}/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser5}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "projectId": 1,
  "title": "Unauthorized Task Injection"
}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### LIST & FILTER TASKS TESTS (GET /api/tasks)
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 6. Get All Tasks for Authenticated User (Expect: 200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser1}}

### 7. Filter Tasks by Project ID (Expect: 200 OK filtered to Project 1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks?projectId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser1}}

### 8. Filter Tasks by Status (Expect: 200 OK filtered to 'In Progress')
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks?status=In Progress
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser1}}

### 9. Filter Tasks by Priority (Expect: 200 OK filtered to 'High')
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks?priority=High
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser1}}

### 10. Filter Tasks by Assignee ID (Expect: 200 OK filtered to Sarah Wilson id: 2)
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks?assigneeId=2
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser1}}

### 11. Combined Filters: Project + Status + Priority (Expect: 200 OK matching all 3)
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks?projectId=1&status=In Progress&priority=High
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser1}}

### 12. Combined Filters resulting in Empty Results (Expect: 200 OK with empty array)
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks?projectId=1&status=Completed&priority=Low
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser1}}

### 13. Search Tasks by Keyword (Expect: 200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks?search=Security
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser1}}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### GET SINGLE TASK BY ID (GET /api/tasks/:id)
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 14. Get Single Task Success (Expect: 200 OK with details)
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks/1
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser1}}

### 15. Unauthorized Read: User 5 attempts to view User 1's task (Expect: 403 Forbidden)
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks/1
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser5}}

### 16. Get Non-Existent Task (Expect: 404 Not Found)
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks/99999
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser1}}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### UPDATE TASK (PUT /api/tasks/:id)
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 17. Update Task by Owner (Expect: 200 OK - move to Completed)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{newTaskId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Set up CI/CD Pipeline on GitHub Actions (v2)",
  "status": "Completed",
  "priority": "High",
  "checklist": [
    { "id": 1, "text": "Create workflow yml file", "done": true },
    { "id": 2, "text": "Configure repository secrets", "done": true }
  ]
}

### 18. Unauthorized Update: User 5 attempts to update User 1's task (Expect: 403 Forbidden)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/tasks/1
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser5}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Hacked Task Title"
}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### DELETE TASK (DELETE /api/tasks/:id)
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 19. Unauthorized Deletion: User 5 attempts to delete User 1's task (Expect: 403 Forbidden)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/tasks/1
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser5}}

### 20. Delete Task by Owner (Expect: 200 OK)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{newTaskId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser1}}

### 21. Verify 404 after Deletion
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{newTaskId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser1}}

### 22. Access Task Endpoints Without Token (Expect: 401 Unauthorized)
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks
